From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: redate: add an interactive timestamp editor

Add a revision picker using the configured graph style, log node template,
and command-specific row template. Show all mutable revisions by default

Use stable checked markers, full-row focus highlighting, responsive key
hints, select-all, boundary navigation, anchored Shift range selection,
and the standard c-to-confirm binding

Accept exact and relative local-time expressions and --timestamp for
non-interactive use. Preserve explicit offsets and descendant metadata,
and make signing selected revisions opt-in with --sign

Assisted-by: GPT-6
